  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Ouganda - Projet de r&#xe9;habilitation des r&#xe9;seaux d&apos;eau et d&apos;assainissement de cinq centres urbains</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda - Five Urban Centres Water &amp; Sewerage Rehabilitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.OVERALL OBJECTIVE : To improve public health and enhance the socio-economique development of the community in the project areas. 2. SPECIFIC OBJECTIVES : The project aims at augmenting the capacity of existing water sources, treatment plants, transmission mains and storage facilities at Gulu, Lira and Kamuli and the provision of new water supply stem for Kabermaido. Augmentation and rehabilitation of sanitation systems for Gulu, Lira and Mbarara are also included under the project.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
